# The FPS prototype uses third-party Unity Asset Store models, audio, shaders, and Editor packages.
# Keeping only the folders known to contain my own work.
# This is intentionally a PARTIAL Unity source project.
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Scripts/
!/Assets/Scripts.meta
!/Assets/Animacije/
!/Assets/Animacije.meta
!/Assets/Scene/
!/Assets/Scene.meta
